{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the futuristic techno-metropolis of Nu-Vika,</strong> you are but a number in the system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been branded as unemployed, and rely on the state to survive. Until\u00a0you are assigned a\u00a0temporary position at a cyborg repair workshop,\u00a0 giving you a shot at gaining freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when strange glitches start happening to your eye implants, you find yourself thrust into\u00a0a plan far beyond your comprehension, tying your fate to one of three patients in your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/15bb6c5d989e543ff1d7b1d058dc5421.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/3f70858af463e21e25f652181bf0255e.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/196907cc38aa61111659ede22d832619.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>TEKNOKRAT</i></strong> is a gay, y2k-fuelled sci-fi thriller/romance about the danger of enforced stagnation in the face of unstoppable change.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city where might makes right, and technology is absolute.\u00a0Choose a partner in crime, and face the consequences of your actions with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 75k words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 major routes following 3 mysterious cyborgs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different endings where your choices determine the fate of the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the insides of your cyborg clients - strictly professionally of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate conspiracy,\u00a0bureaucracy, and intimacy in a cyberpunk metropolis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-inspired original artwork and bouncy techno soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can kiss the cyborgs.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732260?t=1767368854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/a4c8ca58defa5520333d151910d4e6c1280531de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767368854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/e2d8f5af0265c41cb2343f9dde11f55128e2f3b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767368854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/e2d8f5af0265c41cb2343f9dde11f55128e2f3b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767368854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game is intended for an adult audience, and contains references to sex and drugs, as well as portrayals of gore, violence and terrorism."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the futuristic techno-metropolis of Nu-Vika,</strong> you are but a number in the system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been branded as unemployed, and rely on the state to survive. Until\u00a0you are assigned a\u00a0temporary position at a cyborg repair workshop,\u00a0 giving you a shot at gaining freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when strange glitches start happening to your eye implants, you find yourself thrust into\u00a0a plan far beyond your comprehension, tying your fate to one of three patients in your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/15bb6c5d989e543ff1d7b1d058dc5421.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/3f70858af463e21e25f652181bf0255e.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/extras/196907cc38aa61111659ede22d832619.avif?t=1767368854\" width=640 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>TEKNOKRAT</i></strong> is a gay, y2k-fuelled sci-fi thriller/romance about the danger of enforced stagnation in the face of unstoppable change.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city where might makes right, and technology is absolute.\u00a0Choose a partner in crime, and face the consequences of your actions with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 75k words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 major routes following 3 mysterious cyborgs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different endings where your choices determine the fate of the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the insides of your cyborg clients - strictly professionally of course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate conspiracy,\u00a0bureaucracy, and intimacy in a cyberpunk metropolis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-inspired original artwork and bouncy techno soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can kiss the cyborgs.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vertebrae Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732260/5930934feda91e666f77befafcaa79459092dfd3/header.jpg?t=1767368854","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3732260/1370668753/a8dbe1b3c7c4af62527210570d0e1c401e3e1dc6/1753965223/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755963075","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3732260/1370668753/a8dbe1b3c7c4af62527210570d0e1c401e3e1dc6/1753965223/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755963075","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3732260/1370668753/a8dbe1b3c7c4af62527210570d0e1c401e3e1dc6/1753965223/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755963075","id":257176227,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176227/b7d973ad73bee9f9a769c15f4044173277279740/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755963075"}],"name":"TEKNOKRAT","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 or DirectX 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Vertebrae Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00c3\u00aancia\nTemas sens\u00c3\u00adveis\nDrogas il\u00c3\u00adcitas","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"stea